%%{init: {'theme':'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as UI Components<br/>(MiniPlayerBar, QueueButton,<br/>LessonViewer, CoachInbox,<br/>NudgeCard, CoachChat)
    participant LIB as activity-telemetry.ts<br/>(formerly audio-telemetry.ts)
    participant THR as Throttle Map<br/>(in-memory)
    participant DED as Dedupe Set<br/>(per session, React Context)
    participant PII as PII Guard (client-side)
    participant BAT as Batch Buffer<br/>(cap 10, flush 5s OR full)
    participant BAK as Offline Backlog<br/>(localStorage cap 100)
    participant BCN as navigator.sendBeacon<br/>(fallback fetch keepalive)
    participant API as POST /api/user-activity/batch
    participant SRV as userActivityRouter
    participant SPI as stripPII (server)<br/>cap metadata 10KB
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>user_activity table

    Note over U,DB: Happy path — emitAudioEvent('audio.play', payload)

    U->>UI: Click play button
    UI->>LIB: emitAudioEvent('audio.play', { track_id, source_driver, queue_position, queue_length })
    LIB->>PII: Check metadata keys vs PROHIBITED Set<br/>(email, displayName, name, phone, cpf, paymentCard, address)
    alt key prohibited detected
        PII->>LIB: console.warn (dev) + DROP event
        Note over PII,LIB: lesson #9: log antes do swallow
        LIB-->>UI: return (best-effort, no throw)
    else clean
        PII-->>LIB: ok
    end

    LIB->>THR: check throttle(action, key)
    Note over THR: Policies (ADR-207 §4):<br/>- audio.seek: 1s same trackId<br/>- library.progress.upsert: 5s same lessonId<br/>- default: 30s same (action, lessonId)
    alt throttled (within window)
        THR-->>LIB: skip silently
        LIB-->>UI: return
    else not throttled
        THR->>THR: lastTs[key] = now
    end

    LIB->>DED: check dedupe(action, lessonId)
    Note over DED: Eventos session-scoped:<br/>- lesson.completion_pct_25/50/75/100<br/>- audio.lesson_complete<br/>(1x per session+lessonId)
    alt already emitted this session
        DED-->>LIB: skip
        LIB-->>UI: return
    else first time
        DED->>DED: set.add(`${action}:${lessonId}`)
    end

    LIB->>BAT: push event {<br/>  action, feature, page, duration, metadata: { ..., meta_v: 1 }<br/>}
    Note over BAT: Buffer fills ate cap=10 OR<br/>setTimeout 5s OR pagehide
    alt buffer full (10) OR pagehide trigger
        BAT->>BCN: sendBeacon(<br/>  '/api/user-activity/batch',<br/>  Blob JSON { events: [...] }<br/>)
        alt sendBeacon retorna false (size > 64KB OR offline)
            BCN->>BAK: push events to localStorage backlog<br/>(cap 100, FIFO drop)
            Note over BAK: Backlog drained no proximo mount<br/>via setTimeout 2s post-init
        else sendBeacon ok
            BCN->>API: POST batch
        end
    end

    API->>SRV: route handler
    SRV->>SPI: stripPII(events[].metadata)
    alt key in PII_KEYS Set (email, displayName, name, +ADR-207 extensions)
        SPI->>SPI: delete metadata[key]
    end
    SPI->>SPI: cap JSON.stringify(metadata).length <= 10KB<br/>(reject 400 if exceeded)
    SPI-->>SRV: cleaned events[]
    SRV->>DB: bulk INSERT user_activity (id, user_id, page, action, feature, duration, metadata, ip_address, user_agent, created_at)
    DB-->>SRV: rows[]
    SRV-->>API: 200 { inserted: N }
    API-->>BCN: response (best-effort, ignored by sendBeacon caller)

    Note over U,DB: 4 dominios cobertos: audio.* (8 events) + lesson.* (6) + coach.* (4) + library.* (1 canary RF-05)

    Note over UI,LIB: PROHIBITED em metadata (ADR-207 §3):<br/>email, displayName, name, phone, cpf,<br/>payment_card, address, tokens, IPs,<br/>texto livre digitado.<br/>PERMITIDO: IDs (lessonId, courseSlug,<br/>nudgeId, trackId), flags (tier, driver,<br/>format, reason), counts (duration, tokens).
